            <title>[ZEPPELIN-755] Invalid notebook JSON file prevents Zeppelin daemon from starting</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-755</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
